{"The spirit of the forest can be met and addressed by sacrificing silver at an ant nest. You do it alone at night, and then wait for the spirit to arrive. Do not fear and he may speak and show himself to you before dawn.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"The very first fish of the spring that you catch with a fishing rod in open water season should be thrown back into the water to please the spirit of the water and assure your future fishing luck.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"To get to see spirits of the water you should go stand naked on a rock in the water at night. It must be a single rock or skerry, completely surrounded by water, and the water folk may gather around it at midnight.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"To make a fox trap favourable leave it laying at doorstep of a building where womenfolk will get to walk over it.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"Turn around and kick a tree with your heel and the squirrel will then stay still in there, even if it would have been jumping around a lot earlier.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"When deadfall trap is made for a bear you should then set the meat bait there completely naked. Then the bear gets in there nicely.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"When first fish of the spring are caught out at a lake in open water season, make a fish soup or boil them right after returning on shore. When it's cooked, go away from the pot so that the spirit of the water can have the first taste.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"When going rod fishing you should first throw the fishing rod into the water, and then you have a good fishing luck.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
{"You get a good catch if you step in the punt backwards and launch it in the water backwards.","",'t',"","conversation.form"},
